                    %mi 𝒢
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P(N,\mathcal{G})
              for the groupoid
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒢
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{G}
              pulled back to the underlying set of
