                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} x \in X_0 = Obj(\Pi_1(X,X_0))
              take the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/module+over+a+groupoid"} modules over
